hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"394","On the authority of Ahmad ibn Sinan al-Wasiti, on the authority of Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi, on the authority of Shu`bah, on the authority of Muhajir Abi al-Hassan, who said: I heard Zayd ibn Wahb, He said: I heard Abu Dharr, he said: We were with the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, on a journey, and the muezzin wanted to give the call to prayer, so he said: “Cool down,” then He wanted to give the call to prayer, so he said: “It gets colder.” Shu’bah said: until the shadow reached the hills. Then the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The intensity of the heat From the stench of Hell, cool them down with prayer.”"
